# Null value -> 200; missing/null age -> 400, fields=[children[first].age]
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{mapGroup}}/values/nullable/cascade/valid
Content-Type: application/json

{{body}}

### 13. Value nullable=O, value @NotNull=O, value @Valid=X, Controller @Valid=X
